    "name": "NeverAwake FLASHBACK",
    "steam_appid": 3072510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/2a6a5f51ee28ba56ea8454caa5dc03a7.avif?t=1749828307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Here is a new nightmare, reborn as an arcade-like experience.</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cNeverAwake FLASHBACK\u201d is an offshoot of the nightmare action shooter \u201cNeverAwake\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cNeverAwake\u201d is a nightmarish twin-stick shooter with a unique worldview and original game rules, and was awarded the \u201dVERMILION GATE AWARD&quot; for the most outstanding work at BitSummit X-Roads in 2022. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>New game rules!A reborn roguelite shooter based on the nightmare world of \u201cNeverAwake\u201d!</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic specifications of \u201cNeverAwake\u201d have been retained, but the style of the game is more like an arcade shooter, where players progress through shuffled stages in a random order, selecting weapons and accessories available between each stage, providing a challenge in a short time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/56f12bd9b6a9c2772b51d1e584708089.avif?t=1749828307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGabe-chan\u201d, an important existence for the main character Rem, will join the game as a partner to protect Rem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And completely new stages and new bosses have been added!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/185da3ad6e687464c1369b8705cf20d9.avif?t=1749828307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, long-awaited new accessories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine numerous weapons and accessories to fight off the monsters in your nightmares. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Story</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rem woke up safely from the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was feeling better and spending my days with a peaceful mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then he realized that he was having nightmares every night again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could be the cause of the nightmares?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Rem be able to wake up again from more nightmares?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Playing \u201cNeverAwake FLASHBACK\u201d</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick out vegetables, dentists, and other monsters and blow away painful childhood memories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique worldview set in a \u201cgirl's nightmare\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand-drawn graphics and animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique game rules, high retryability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay and powerful boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 levels / dozens of tricky bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous weapons and accessories and their combination builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High storytelling and multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/dd529f018e6576e98fbd3969739cdcc0.avif?t=1749828307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What is \u201cNeverAwake\u201d?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;NeverAwake&quot; has a unique world view with its high quality hand-drawn graphics and its beautiful animation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are not demons...but vegetables and dentists that the girl hates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Things and creatures that everyone has had a bad experience with at least once become monsters and attack the main character \u201cRem\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Rem be able to wake up from his dream again\u2026? </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/2a6a5f51ee28ba56ea8454caa5dc03a7.avif?t=1749828307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Here is a new nightmare, reborn as an arcade-like experience.</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cNeverAwake FLASHBACK\u201d is an offshoot of the nightmare action shooter \u201cNeverAwake\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cNeverAwake\u201d is a nightmarish twin-stick shooter with a unique worldview and original game rules, and was awarded the \u201dVERMILION GATE AWARD&quot; for the most outstanding work at BitSummit X-Roads in 2022. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>New game rules!A reborn roguelite shooter based on the nightmare world of \u201cNeverAwake\u201d!</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic specifications of \u201cNeverAwake\u201d have been retained, but the style of the game is more like an arcade shooter, where players progress through shuffled stages in a random order, selecting weapons and accessories available between each stage, providing a challenge in a short time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/56f12bd9b6a9c2772b51d1e584708089.avif?t=1749828307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGabe-chan\u201d, an important existence for the main character Rem, will join the game as a partner to protect Rem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And completely new stages and new bosses have been added!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/185da3ad6e687464c1369b8705cf20d9.avif?t=1749828307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, long-awaited new accessories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine numerous weapons and accessories to fight off the monsters in your nightmares. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Story</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rem woke up safely from the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was feeling better and spending my days with a peaceful mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then he realized that he was having nightmares every night again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could be the cause of the nightmares?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Rem be able to wake up again from more nightmares?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Playing \u201cNeverAwake FLASHBACK\u201d</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick out vegetables, dentists, and other monsters and blow away painful childhood memories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique worldview set in a \u201cgirl's nightmare\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand-drawn graphics and animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique game rules, high retryability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay and powerful boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 levels / dozens of tricky bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous weapons and accessories and their combination builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High storytelling and multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/dd529f018e6576e98fbd3969739cdcc0.avif?t=1749828307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What is \u201cNeverAwake\u201d?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;NeverAwake&quot; has a unique world view with its high quality hand-drawn graphics and its beautiful animation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are not demons...but vegetables and dentists that the girl hates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Things and creatures that everyone has had a bad experience with at least once become monsters and attack the main character \u201cRem\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Rem be able to wake up from his dream again\u2026? </p>",
